## Business rules (operator-confirmed)

### Everyone registers + waivers
Every player **including team captain** must complete
`/register?tournament=world-cup-summer-tournament` and sign DocuSeal waiver.
No exceptions for people who will play.

### Team payment (on `/pay` for World Cup slug only)

| Option | Who | Amount |
|---|---|---|
| **Pay full team** | Captain (main path) | **$960 flat** always |
| **Pay my share** | Each player when splitting | **$960 ÷ roster_size**; roster_size **8–12** |
| **My captain already paid** | Player after waiver | **$0** — skip Stripe; admin marks paid when building roster |

- **Team name** field on pay (full team + share paths) → store on
  `registrations.team_name` + Stripe/payment metadata → visible in admin.
- Group A/B assignment, WhatsApp groups: **manual admin** — not on public site.
- Split payment: **honor system** (each player picks same roster size; admin
  reconciles).

### Spring Classic
Slug `spring-classic-2026` → mark **`status = completed`** (WC-2). Consider
closing `registration_open` / `payments_open` / `is_featured`.

