### Phase WC-5 — Checkout API + team name storage

**Goal:** Stripe checkout supports World Cup pay kinds; team name persisted.

**Files:**
- `src/app/api/stripe/checkout/route.ts`
- New optional: `src/app/api/register/captain-paid-ack/route.ts` (or extend
  existing register API)

**Extend checkout body (guarded, no `any`):**
```ts
payKind?: "entry" | "drop_in" | "team_full" | "team_share" | "captain_paid_ack";
rosterSize?: number;  // 8–12 when team_share
teamName?: string;
```

- `team_full` → 96000 cents
- `team_share` → `Math.round(96000 / rosterSize)`
- `captain_paid_ack` → no Stripe; update registration `payment_status` +
  `team_name` + note for admin review

Stripe metadata: `pay_kind`, `team_name`, `roster_size`, `tournament_id`,
`registration_id`.

**Manual test:** Stripe test mode — $960 checkout; $96 for 10-player share;
captain-paid ack stores team name without charge.

