- No admin auth refactor.
- No auto Group A/B or WhatsApp integration.
- No new npm packages.
- No destructive DB migrations (use existing `registrations.team_name`).
- Do not set `entry_fee_cents = 96000` on tournament row without WC-4 pay UI
